OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe unexplained death of
OL,4,Afour-month-old baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland are looking into the
OL,7,Fdeath of a four-month-old baby in the
OL,8,Fnorth of Glasgow.
OL,10,FThe death occurred inside a property in
OL,11,FMilton and was reported on Wednesday.
OL,13,FThe force said it was being treated as
OL,14,Funexplained.
OL,16,FA spokesperson said: "Inquiries are
OL,17,Fongoing to establish the
OL,18,Fcircumstances."
